      "summary": {
        "text": "Bryce Aron (born September 30, 2003) is an American racing driver who will compete in the 2027 Indy NXT Championship for Cape Motorsports powered by Ed Carpenter Racing. A multiple-time race winner in European open-wheel competition, Aron has also competed in the premier GTP class of the IMSA SportsCar Championship, finishing sixth overall on his debut at the 2025 24 Hours of Daytona. Aron tested for Jaguar TCS Racing in Formula E at the Madrid test.",
